    {
      "id": "813813a4-fabe-4187-b7c4-2b5c18f4727f",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -896,
        512
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 832,
        "height": 672,
        "content": "## Loan Application Notification & Monitoring\n\nThe workflow checks the Application Tracker every 30 minutes for application status changes. Changed applications are evaluated for SLA breaches and high-value loans. SLA breaches trigger a Slack alert, while high-value applications are escalated to the manager by email. For status changes, Gemini generates a personalized applicant email which is sent through Gmail. Failed emails are automatically retried up to 3 times and permanently logged when retries are exhausted. A separate weekday 6 PM schedule aggregates the complete application pipeline and uses Gemini to generate a daily management digest.\n\n### Setup\n\nConnect Google Sheets, Gmail, Slack, and Google Gemini credentials.\nConfigure the Application Tracker sheet with application/status fields.\nSet MANAGER_EMAIL as an n8n environment variable.\nVerify the Slack #loan-alerts channel and permissions.\nAdjust the 3-day SLA and \u20b92,000,000 high-value threshold if required.\nActivate the workflow and verify both applicant notifications and the daily report."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "27e20328-dd0c-4999-b74c-f9a6a375aa32",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        512
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 624,
        "height": 672,
        "content": "### Application Monitoring\n\nRuns every 30 minutes, reads the application tracker, detects status changes, identifies applications that have remained under review for more than 3 days, and flags high-value loans above the configured threshold."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "caf9a45d-d14e-4270-bcd7-6c7dbbe19aaa",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        688,
        512
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 832,
        "height": 672,
        "content": "### Risk & Escalation\n\nSLA-breached applications generate an immediate Slack alert. High-value applications are additionally escalated to the manager by email. Normal applications continue through the standard applicant notification process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3b973b8a-6c10-45d8-817f-6969ef36ec96",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1584,
        512
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 1024,
        "height": 672,
        "content": "### Applicant Notifications\n\nChanged applications are processed individually. Gemini generates a short, status-specific email using the applicant and loan information, and Gmail sends the notification directly to the applicant."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "56f242ec-0487-4275-8255-e740d14296a4",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2672,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 768,
        "height": 928,
        "content": "### Email Retry Handling\n\nFailed applicant emails are retried after a 5-minute delay. The retry counter prevents unlimited attempts. After three failed attempts, the application and failure details are recorded in the failure log sheet for manual follow-up."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ef39f796-a86a-4177-8612-7c646565b359",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        1296
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 1360,
        "height": 624,
        "content": "### Daily Management Digest\n\nEvery weekday at 6 PM, the workflow reads the complete application tracker, calculates status totals and SLA breaches, and uses Gemini to create a concise management summary. The final report is delivered to the configured manager email."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
